docs {
  # Technical Docs Search API
  
  Requests to exercise the document upload flow (HU-01) end to end.
  
  1. Start the stack: `docker compose up -d` and `./mvnw spring-boot:run` (backend).
  2. Select the **Local** environment.
  3. Run the collection with the Runner: requests run in order and chain IDs through runtime variables.
  
  `Get ...` requests wait 2 seconds before running so the consumer has time to process the document.
}
